# ServiceNow Asset Request & Return Management

## Project Overview
A ServiceNow application developed to manage company assets, asset requests, assignments, status tracking, and returns.

## Objectives
- Manage company assets
- Track asset status
- Manage employee asset requests
- Track asset assignments and returns
- Automate asset record updates
- Monitor assets using reports and dashboards

## Technologies
- ServiceNow Zurich
- App Engine Studio
- Flow Designer
- Record Producer
- Platform Analytics

## Key Features

### Asset Management
Created a custom Asset table with:
- Asset Name
- Asset Tag
- Asset Type
- Serial Number
- Asset Status
- Assigned To
- Assigned Date
- Return Date
- Condition
- Notes

### Asset Request
Created an Asset Request Record Producer for requesting company assets.

### Automation
Created a Flow Designer automation that triggers when an Asset record is created and automatically updates the Asset Status.

### Reporting
Created an Asset Request Status Overview report to monitor assets by status.

### Dashboard
Created an Asset Request Management Dashboard using Platform Analytics.

## Workflow

Asset Record Created  
↓  
Automation Triggered  
↓  
Asset Status Updated  
↓  
Asset Assignment / Return Tracking  
↓  
Status Monitoring through Report & Dashboard

